# Canonicalize all traffic onto https://asifasharaf.com
# Note: www.asifasharaf.com must be attached as a custom domain on the
# Cloudflare Pages project for the first rule to take effect.
https://www.asifasharaf.com/* https://asifasharaf.com/:splat 301
https://asifasharaf.pages.dev/* https://asifasharaf.com/:splat 301
